{"seq":2,"slug":"distributed-transactions","title":"分布式事务实现机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-intensive-applications/transactions-and-consistency/distributed-transactions","wordCount":1275,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"分布式事务实现机制\">分布式事务实现机制</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>当数据分布在多个节点或多个服务之间时，保持跨节点操作的原子性成为核心挑战。分布式事务需要确保：要么所有参与节点都提交变更，要么全部回滚——即使在部分节点故障或网络分区的情况下。这一看似简单的需求，在分布式环境下催生了多种复杂度递增的解决方案。</p>\n<p>本文深入分析 2PC、3PC、Saga、TCC 等分布式事务方案的协议流程、失败场景处理和工程权衡，帮助工程师在微服务架构中选择合适的事务策略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"两阶段提交-2pc\">两阶段提交（2PC）</h3><p>2PC 是最经典的分布式事务协议，通过协调者（Coordinator）统一管理参与者的提交决策：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant C as Coordinator&#10;    participant P1 as Participant 1&#10;    participant P2 as Participant 2&#10;&#10;    Note over C,P2: Phase 1 - Prepare&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;P1: Prepare&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;P2: Prepare&#10;    P1-&gt;&gt;C: Vote YES&#10;    P2-&gt;&gt;C: Vote YES&#10;&#10;    Note over C,P2: Phase 2 - Commit&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;P1: Commit&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;P2: Commit&#10;    P1-&gt;&gt;C: ACK&#10;    P2-&gt;&gt;C: ACK\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as Coordinator\n    participant P1 as Participant 1\n    participant P2 as Participant 2\n\n    Note over C,P2: Phase 1 - Prepare\n    C-&gt;&gt;P1: Prepare\n    C-&gt;&gt;P2: Prepare\n    P1-&gt;&gt;C: Vote YES\n    P2-&gt;&gt;C: Vote YES\n\n    Note over C,P2: Phase 2 - Commit\n    C-&gt;&gt;P1: Commit\n    C-&gt;&gt;P2: Commit\n    P1-&gt;&gt;C: ACK\n    P2-&gt;&gt;C: ACK</pre><p><strong>2PC 的关键问题：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>阻塞</td>\n<td>参与者投票 YES 后必须等待协调者决策</td>\n<td>资源锁定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>协调者单点</td>\n<td>协调者崩溃导致参与者无限等待</td>\n<td>系统不可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络分区</td>\n<td>部分参与者收到 Commit，部分未收到</td>\n<td>数据不一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能</td>\n<td>两轮网络往返 + 多次日志刷盘</td>\n<td>延迟高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>参与者状态机：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"INIT → (收到 Prepare) → PREPARED&#10;  ↓                        ↓&#10;  (超时/错误)              (收到 Commit) → COMMITTED&#10;  ↓                        ↓&#10;ABORTED                 (收到 Abort) → ABORTED&#10;                           ↓&#10;                        (协调者崩溃, PREPARED 状态) → BLOCKED! (不确定状态)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>INIT → (收到 Prepare) → PREPARED</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ↓                        ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (超时/错误)              (收到 Commit) → COMMITTED</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ↓                        ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ABORTED                 (收到 Abort) → ABORTED</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                           ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        (协调者崩溃, PREPARED 状态) → BLOCKED! (不确定状态)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"三阶段提交-3pc\">三阶段提交（3PC）</h3><p>3PC 在 Prepare 和 Commit 之间增加 Pre-Commit 阶段，减少阻塞窗口：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Phase 1 (CanCommit): 协调者询问参与者是否能提交&#10;Phase 2 (PreCommit): 协调者发送预提交，参与者持久化准备状态&#10;Phase 3 (DoCommit):  协调者发送最终提交&#10;&#10;改进: 参与者在 PreCommit 后超时可以自主决定提交&#10;       (因为收到 PreCommit 说明所有人投了 YES)&#10;缺点: 网络分区下仍可能不一致，实际系统很少使用\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Phase 1 (CanCommit): 协调者询问参与者是否能提交</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Phase 2 (PreCommit): 协调者发送预提交，参与者持久化准备状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Phase 3 (DoCommit):  协调者发送最终提交</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>改进: 参与者在 PreCommit 后超时可以自主决定提交</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       (因为收到 PreCommit 说明所有人投了 YES)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>缺点: 网络分区下仍可能不一致，实际系统很少使用</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"saga-模式\">Saga 模式</h3><p>Saga 将长事务拆分为一系列本地事务，每个步骤有对应的补偿操作。当某步失败时，按逆序执行已完成步骤的补偿：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    T1[&quot;T1: Create Order&quot;] --&gt; T2[&quot;T2: Reserve Stock&quot;]&#10;    T2 --&gt; T3[&quot;T3: Charge Payment&quot;]&#10;    T3 --&gt; T4[&quot;T4: Ship Order&quot;]&#10;&#10;    T4 -.-&gt;|&quot;Failure&quot;| C3[&quot;C3: Refund Payment&quot;]&#10;    C3 -.-&gt; C2[&quot;C2: Release Stock&quot;]&#10;    C2 -.-&gt; C1[&quot;C1: Cancel Order&quot;]\">graph LR\n    T1[\"T1: Create Order\"] --&gt; T2[\"T2: Reserve Stock\"]\n    T2 --&gt; T3[\"T3: Charge Payment\"]\n    T3 --&gt; T4[\"T4: Ship Order\"]\n\n    T4 -.-&gt;|\"Failure\"| C3[\"C3: Refund Payment\"]\n    C3 -.-&gt; C2[\"C2: Release Stock\"]\n    C2 -.-&gt; C1[\"C1: Cancel Order\"]</pre><p><strong>Saga 的两种编排方式：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>编排式 (Choreography)</td>\n<td>事件驱动，各服务监听事件</td>\n<td>松耦合，无中心瓶颈</td>\n<td>难以追踪全局状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>协调式 (Orchestration)</td>\n<td>中央协调器控制流程</td>\n<td>流程清晰可观测</td>\n<td>协调器可能成为瓶颈</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>协调式 Saga 实现：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class SagaOrchestrator:&#10;    def __init__(self):&#10;        self.steps = []&#10;        self.completed = []&#10;&#10;    def add_step(self, action, compensation):&#10;        self.steps.append({&#39;action&#39;: action, &#39;compensation&#39;: compensation})&#10;&#10;    async def execute(self):&#10;        for i, step in enumerate(self.steps):&#10;            try:&#10;                result = await step[&#39;action&#39;]()&#10;                self.completed.append({&#39;step&#39;: i, &#39;result&#39;: result})&#10;            except Exception as e:&#10;                # 失败: 逆序执行补偿&#10;                await self._compensate()&#10;                raise SagaAborted(f&quot;Step {i} failed: {e}&quot;)&#10;        return self.completed&#10;&#10;    async def _compensate(self):&#10;        for completed in reversed(self.completed):&#10;            step = self.steps[completed[&#39;step&#39;]]&#10;            try:&#10;                await step[&#39;compensation&#39;](completed[&#39;result&#39;])&#10;            except Exception as e:&#10;                # 补偿失败: 记录到死信队列，人工介入&#10;                await self._dead_letter(completed, e)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SagaOrchestrator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.steps </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.completed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> add_step</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, action, compensation):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.steps.append({</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'action'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: action, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'compensation'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: compensation})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> execute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i, step </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> enumerate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.steps):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> step[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'action'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">                self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.completed.append({</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'step'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: i, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'result'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: result})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            except</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Exception</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> e:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                # 失败: 逆序执行补偿</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._compensate()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                raise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SagaAborted(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Step </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">i</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> failed: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">e</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.completed</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> _compensate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> completed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> reversed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.completed):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            step </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.steps[completed[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'step'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> step[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'compensation'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">](completed[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'result'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            except</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Exception</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> e:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                # 补偿失败: 记录到死信队列，人工介入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._dead_letter(completed, e)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"tcc-模式-try-confirm-cancel\">TCC 模式（Try-Confirm-Cancel）</h3><p>TCC 是业务层面的 2PC，将事务逻辑拆分为三个阶段：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Try</td>\n<td>预留资源/检查业务条件</td>\n<td>资源不真正扣减，只是&quot;冻结&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Confirm</td>\n<td>确认执行，真正扣减资源</td>\n<td>幂等操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cancel</td>\n<td>释放预留资源</td>\n<td>幂等操作</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class TCCTransferService:&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;TCC 转账示例&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;&#10;    async def try_transfer(self, from_account, to_account, amount, tx_id):&#10;        &quot;&quot;&quot;Try: 冻结资金&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;        # 检查余额并冻结（不真正扣款）&#10;        await self.account_service.freeze(from_account, amount, tx_id)&#10;        await self.account_service.prepare_credit(to_account, amount, tx_id)&#10;        return tx_id&#10;&#10;    async def confirm_transfer(self, tx_id):&#10;        &quot;&quot;&quot;Confirm: 真正执行转账（幂等）&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;        await self.account_service.deduct_frozen(tx_id)&#10;        await self.account_service.credit_prepared(tx_id)&#10;&#10;    async def cancel_transfer(self, tx_id):&#10;        &quot;&quot;&quot;Cancel: 释放冻结资金（幂等）&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;        await self.account_service.unfreeze(tx_id)&#10;        await self.account_service.cancel_credit(tx_id)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TCCTransferService</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"TCC 转账示例\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> try_transfer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, from_account, to_account, amount, tx_id):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"\"\"Try: 冻结资金\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 检查余额并冻结（不真正扣款）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.account_service.freeze(from_account, amount, tx_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.account_service.prepare_credit(to_account, amount, tx_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tx_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> confirm_transfer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, tx_id):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"\"\"Confirm: 真正执行转账（幂等）\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.account_service.deduct_frozen(tx_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.account_service.credit_prepared(tx_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> cancel_transfer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, tx_id):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"\"\"Cancel: 释放冻结资金（幂等）\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.account_service.unfreeze(tx_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.account_service.cancel_credit(tx_id)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"google-spanner-的-truetime\">Google Spanner 的 TrueTime</h3><p>Spanner 通过硬件级时间同步（GPS + 原子钟）实现外部一致性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"TrueTime API:&#10;  TT.now() → [earliest, latest]  // 返回时间区间而非精确时间点&#10;  误差范围: 通常 &lt; 7ms&#10;&#10;提交协议:&#10;  1. 获取 TrueTime 区间 [t_start, t_end]&#10;  2. 选择 commit timestamp s &gt;= t_end (等待不确定性窗口)&#10;  3. 等待直到 TT.now().earliest &gt; s (commit-wait)&#10;  4. 此时可以确定: 所有后续事务的 timestamp &gt; s&#10;&#10;效果: 不依赖网络同步即可实现全球强一致性&#10;代价: 每次提交额外等待 ~7ms (TrueTime 不确定性)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>TrueTime API:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  TT.now() → [earliest, latest]  // 返回时间区间而非精确时间点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  误差范围: 通常 &#x3C; 7ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>提交协议:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  1. 获取 TrueTime 区间 [t_start, t_end]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  2. 选择 commit timestamp s >= t_end (等待不确定性窗口)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  3. 等待直到 TT.now().earliest > s (commit-wait)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  4. 此时可以确定: 所有后续事务的 timestamp > s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>效果: 不依赖网络同步即可实现全球强一致性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>代价: 每次提交额外等待 ~7ms (TrueTime 不确定性)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"实战指南\">实战指南</h2><h3 id=\"方案选择决策树\">方案选择决策树</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;Need cross-service atomicity?&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;Strong consistency required?&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|Yes| C{&quot;Latency sensitive?&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|No| D[&quot;Saga - Eventual Consistency&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|Yes| E{&quot;Resources can be reserved?&quot;}&#10;    C --&gt;|No| F[&quot;2PC - XA Transaction&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt;|Yes| G[&quot;TCC - Business-level 2PC&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt;|No| F\">graph TD\n    A[\"Need cross-service atomicity?\"] --&gt; B{\"Strong consistency required?\"}\n    B --&gt;|Yes| C{\"Latency sensitive?\"}\n    B --&gt;|No| D[\"Saga - Eventual Consistency\"]\n    C --&gt;|Yes| E{\"Resources can be reserved?\"}\n    C --&gt;|No| F[\"2PC - XA Transaction\"]\n    E --&gt;|Yes| G[\"TCC - Business-level 2PC\"]\n    E --&gt;|No| F</pre><h3 id=\"微服务中的-saga-实践\">微服务中的 Saga 实践</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# 订单创建 Saga 定义 (伪 YAML)&#10;saga: create-order&#10;steps:&#10;  - name: create-order&#10;    service: order-service&#10;    action: POST /orders&#10;    compensation: DELETE /orders/{orderId}&#10;&#10;  - name: reserve-inventory&#10;    service: inventory-service&#10;    action: POST /inventory/reserve&#10;    compensation: POST /inventory/release&#10;&#10;  - name: process-payment&#10;    service: payment-service&#10;    action: POST /payments&#10;    compensation: POST /payments/{paymentId}/refund&#10;&#10;  - name: notify-shipping&#10;    service: shipping-service&#10;    action: POST /shipments&#10;    compensation: POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/cancel&#10;&#10;timeout: 30s&#10;retry_policy:&#10;  max_attempts: 3&#10;  backoff: exponential\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 订单创建 Saga 定义 (伪 YAML)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">saga</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">create-order</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">create-order</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    service</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">order-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">POST /orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    compensation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">DELETE /orders/{orderId}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">reserve-inventory</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    service</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">inventory-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">POST /inventory/reserve</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    compensation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">POST /inventory/release</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#242